  "correct": "4",
  "solution": "Given equation: 35 % 4 % 12 % 3 % 6 % 5 % 5\n\nBODMAS Table: \n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/7751840ca1840d12cadc428f84d30e2cdcd5e7f82d52a57de21f2404c58eed88.png] \n\nLet's check each option one by one.\n\nOption 1) +, ̶ , ÷, ×, =, +\n\nGiven: 35 % 4 % 12 % 3 % 6 % 5 % 5\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 35 + 4 - __**12 ÷ 3**__ × 6 = 5 + 5\n\n⇒ 35 + 4 - __**4**____** ×**____** 6**__ = 5 + 5\n\n⇒ __**35 + 4**__ - 24 = __**5 **____**+ 5**__\n\n⇒ **__39 -24__** = 10\n\n⇒ 15 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 2) ̶ , +, ×, =, ÷, +\n\nGiven: 35 % 4 % 12 % 3 % 6 % 5 % 5\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 35 - 4 + 12 × 3 = __**6 ÷ 5**__ + 5\n\n⇒ 35 - 4 + __**12 **____**×**____** 3**__ = 1.2 + 5\n\n⇒ __**35**__ - 4 __**+ 36**__ = __**1.2**____** + 5**__\n\n⇒ **__71 - 4__** = 6.2\n\n⇒ 67 ≠ 6.2\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\nOption 3) ̶ , +, ÷, ×, =, +\n\nGiven: 35 % 4 % 12 % 3 % 6 % 5 % 5\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 35 - 4 + __**12 ÷ 3**__ × 6 = 5 + 5\n\n⇒ 35 - 4 + __**4**____** ×**____** 6**__ = 5 + 5\n\n⇒ __**35**__ - 4 __**+ 24**__ = __**5 + 5**__\n\n⇒ __**59 - 4**__ = 10\n\n⇒ 55 ≠ 10\n\n⇒ LHS ≠ RHS\n\n**Option 4) ̶ , +, ÷, =, ×, +**\n\nGiven: 35 % 4 % 12 % 3 % 6 % 5 % 5\n\nAfter interchanging the signs we get;\n\n⇒ 35 - 4 + __**12 ÷ 3**__ = 6 × 5 + 5\n\n⇒ 35 - 4 + 4 = __**6 **____**×**____** 5**__ + 5\n\n⇒ __**35**__ - 4 __**+ 4**__ = __**30**____** + 5**__\n\n⇒ __**39 - 4**__ = 35\n\n**⇒ 35 = 35**\n\n**⇒ LHS = RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is \"Option 4\".\n\n2f",
